claim.claim-text:
a plate supporter configured to support a plate on which a reaction region is placed and blood is placed in the reaction region;
a patch controller configured to use the patch, which is configured to contain the staining reagent, and control a relative position of the patch relative to the reaction region so that the staining reagent is provided to the reaction region; and
a reaction detector configured to detect a result of staining of the staining target present in the blood to examine the blood.
